# Milestones

M0 and M1 are implemented. Do not start a later milestone unless the user asks for it.

- M2 is `xen.transport`, `TempoSource`, and `xenakis run --no-audio`.
- M3 is `xen.paths` (polylines, cubic Béziers, cursors, triggers).
- M4 is `xen.osc` (UDP, `/xen/...` addresses, timetagged bundles).
- M5 is the UI container: toolbar, layers, time grid, inspector, OSC panel.
- M6 is the Windows installer and soak test.

Spikes under `spikes/` stay prototypes. Do not promote spike code into an xPlugin.

Locked product decisions live in `docs/decisions.md`. If a change would contradict them, stop and say so.
